cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Trinity B007: VSA Operations"
title: "Trinity B007: VSA Operations for Ternary Computing"
abstract: "We present a comprehensive framework for Vector Symbolic Architecture (VSA) operations optimized for ternary computing. Our implementation includes four VSA architectures: Binary Sparse Code (BSC), Holographic Reduced Representations (HRR), Fourier HRR (FHRR), and the novel BSD-VSA which integrates elliptic curve theory through the Tate-Shafarevich (Ш) component."
